sequenceDiagram
    %% Internal Module Communication Lifecycle
    autonumber
    actor Student as Student (Browser)
    actor Faculty as Faculty (Browser)
    participant Auth as Auth & RBAC Interceptor
    participant ExamSvc as ExamService
    participant AttemptSvc as AttemptService
    participant EvalSvc as EvaluationService
    participant AuditSvc as AuditLogService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    Note over Faculty, DB: 1. Faculty Exam Authoring Flow
    Faculty->>Auth: POST /api/v1/exams (Exam details + Questions)
    Auth->>Auth: Verify JWT & Require Role FACULTY
    Auth->>ExamSvc: create_exam(user_id, exam_payload)
    ExamSvc->>DB: INSERT into exams & questions (Atomic Tx)
    ExamSvc->>AuditSvc: log_event(EXAM_CREATED, faculty_id, exam_id)
    AuditSvc->>DB: INSERT into audit_logs
    ExamSvc-->>Faculty: HTTP 201 Created (Exam ID)

    Note over Student, DB: 2. Student Examination Attempt Flow
    Student->>Auth: POST /api/v1/exams/{id}/start
    Auth->>Auth: Verify JWT & Require Role STUDENT
    Auth->>AttemptSvc: start_attempt(student_id, exam_id)
    AttemptSvc->>DB: Query exam (check active & published)
    AttemptSvc->>AttemptSvc: Compute server-authoritative expires_at
    AttemptSvc->>DB: INSERT into exam_attempts (status=IN_PROGRESS)
    AttemptSvc->>AuditSvc: log_event(ATTEMPT_STARTED, student_id, attempt_id)
    AuditSvc->>DB: INSERT into audit_logs
    AttemptSvc-->>Student: HTTP 200 OK (attempt_id, expires_at, sanitized questions)

    Note over Student, DB: 3. Authoritative Submission & Tamper-Proof Evaluation
    Student->>Auth: POST /api/v1/attempts/{id}/submit (selected_options)
    Auth->>Auth: Verify JWT & Enforce Ownership (attempt.student_id == user.id)
    Auth->>AttemptSvc: submit_attempt(attempt_id, answers)
    AttemptSvc->>AttemptSvc: Verify server_time <= expires_at + grace_period
    alt Expired Attempt
        AttemptSvc-->>Student: HTTP 400 Bad Request (Attempt Expired)
    else Valid Attempt Window
        AttemptSvc->>EvalSvc: evaluate_and_seal(attempt_id, answers)
        EvalSvc->>DB: Fetch official question keys & marks
        EvalSvc->>EvalSvc: Calculate total score & percentage (Server-Side)
        EvalSvc->>DB: INSERT into results & UPDATE attempt (status=COMPLETED)
        EvalSvc->>AuditSvc: log_event(ATTEMPT_SUBMITTED, student_id, attempt_id)
        AuditSvc->>DB: INSERT into audit_logs
        EvalSvc-->>Student: HTTP 200 OK (Verified Result Summary)
    end
